# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local photo archive - NOT published.
#
# These folders hold the raw material downloaded from the old Wix site:
# full-resolution originals, duplicates of images that were superseded, and
# files the site never uses. Together they are about 245 MB.
#
# Everything the website actually displays has already been copied, resized,
# into assets/images/ and assets/images/wix_gallery_exact/, so nothing here
# is needed to build or serve the site. Keeping them out of git keeps the
# repository small and quick to clone.
#
# The folders stay on your computer - this only stops them being uploaded.
# To publish one of these photos, resize it and copy it into
# assets/images/wix_gallery_exact/ as described in README.md.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
assets/images/wix_downloaded/
assets/images/wix_gallery/
assets/images/wix_originals/
